Package: dqGSEA
Title: Gene Set Enrichment Analysis from Differential Expression Results
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Janmesh", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "jr530@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Runs preranked gene set enrichment analysis from a differential
    expression results table and a GMT pathway file. The package prepares a
    ranked gene vector, runs fgsea, and writes publication-ready summaries.
